<div>
    <h2>Pzordle</h2>
    <p>
        Pzordle is a game where you have to try to guess the daily Planet Zoo 2
        animal. Each time you guess, the game will tell you what you have
        correct, for example the biome or the habitat type, and what you have
        wrong. The goal is to guess the animal in the least amount of tries
        possible.
    </p>
</div>
